1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:04,108
You can only babysit five AI agents before you are the bottleneck.

2
00:00:04,408 --> 00:00:07,086
That estimate comes from DeepSeek's Super-agent team.

3
00:00:07,586 --> 00:00:10,631
You are a general, and your soldiers are AI agents.

4
00:00:10,931 --> 00:00:12,619
Napoleon had the same problem.

5
00:00:12,919 --> 00:00:15,978
He could not shout orders at a hundred thousand soldiers.

6
00:00:16,928 --> 00:00:20,238
Napoleon's fix was one man: Berthier, his chief of staff.

7
00:00:20,538 --> 00:00:22,034
Napoleon said what he wanted.

8
00:00:22,334 --> 00:00:27,177
Berthier wrote the orders and sent them to the corps: small armies that could each fight alone.

9
00:00:27,477 --> 00:00:29,791
DeepSeek's Super-agent works the same way.

10
00:00:30,091 --> 00:00:33,460
One router agent listens on GitHub and in your team chat.

11
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:34,450
Ask once.

12
00:00:34,750 --> 00:00:39,913
It opens a ticket and hands it to a worker agent, with its own session and its own folder.

13
00:00:40,213 --> 00:00:41,726
Many workers march at once.

14
00:00:42,226 --> 00:00:43,392
The router stays quiet.

15
00:00:43,692 --> 00:00:47,101
It speaks up only when you must decide, or can use a result.

16
00:00:47,601 --> 00:00:49,220
It is still a research prototype.

17
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:51,515
But the lesson is two hundred years old.

18
00:00:51,815 --> 00:00:53,577
The limit was never the soldiers.

19
00:00:53,877 --> 00:00:55,473
It was the general's attention.

20
00:00:55,773 --> 00:00:57,176
And now, that general is you.

21
00:00:57,676 --> 00:00:59,078
Subscribe for the next one.
